        "lessons": [
          {
            "title": "Intro",
            "id": 82664,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Saat mengeksplorasi dataset, sebaiknya kamu mengetahui berapa kali suatu data muncul, seperti jawaban yang paling sering muncul dalam survei.</p><code version=\"2\" codelang=\"python\" name=\"script.py\" visible-if=\"always\"><content><text value=\"answers = [\" /><text value=\"&quot;yes&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\", \" /><text value=\"&quot;no&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\", \" /><text value=\"&quot;sometimes&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\", \" /><text value=\"&quot;yes&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\", \" /><text value=\"&quot;no&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\"]\" /></content></code></body></html>",
            "hardModeSelected": true
          },
          {
            "title": "Method call",
            "id": 82665,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Untuk menghitung berapa kali sebuah nilai muncul dalam list seperti <code>answers</code>, mulai dengan nama list, titik <code> .</code>, lalu <code>count()</code>.</p><code version=\"2\" codelang=\"python\" name=\"script.py\" visible-if=\"always\"><content><text value=\"answers = [\" /><text value=\"&quot;yes&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\", \" /><text value=\"&quot;no&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\", \" /><text value=\"&quot;sometimes&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\", \" /><text value=\"&quot;yes&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\"]\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"answers.count()\" /></content><interactions><interaction type=\"fillTheGap\" isDefault=\"true\"><options><option startIndex=\"44\" endIndex=\"51\" /><option startIndex=\"51\" endIndex=\"52\" /><option startIndex=\"52\" endIndex=\"59\" /></options></interaction></interactions></code><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Pastikan kamu memilih <code>answers</code>, diikuti oleh <code>.</code>, dan terakhir <code>count()</code>.</p></body></html>",
            "hardModeSelected": true
          },
          {
            "title": "Element to count",
            "id": 82666,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Untuk menghitung berapa kali <code>\"yes\"</code> muncul dalam list <code>answers</code>, kita menulis <code>\"yes\"</code> di antara tanda kurung <code>count()</code>.</p><code version=\"2\" codelang=\"python\" name=\"script.py\" visible-if=\"always\"><content><text value=\"answers = [\" /><text value=\"&quot;yes&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\", \" /><text value=\"&quot;no&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\", \" /><text value=\"&quot;sometimes&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\", \" /><text value=\"&quot;yes&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\", \" /><text value=\"&quot;no&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\"]\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"print(answers.count(\" /><text value=\"&quot;yes&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\"))\" /></content><interactions><interaction type=\"validatedInput\" isDefault=\"true\" startIndex=\"70\" endIndex=\"75\" /></interactions><output><content><text value=\"2\" /></content></output></code><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Pastikan kamu mengetik <code>\"yes\"</code>.</p></body></html>"
          },
          {
            "title": "Any type",
            "id": 82667,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Kita dapat menggunakan <code>count()</code> dengan jenis nilai apa pun, misalnya memeriksa berapa banyak kursi kosong yang tersisa dalam satu baris berdasarkan jumlah nilai <code>True</code>.</p><code version=\"2\" codelang=\"python\" name=\"script.py\" visible-if=\"always\"><content><text value=\"free_seats = [\" /><text value=\"False\" class=\"literal\" /><text value=\", \" /><text value=\"False\" class=\"literal\" /><text value=\", \" /><text value=\"True\" class=\"literal\" /><text value=\", \" /><text value=\"True\" class=\"literal\" /><text value=\", \" /><text value=\"False\" class=\"literal\" /><text value=\"]\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"print(free_seats.count(\" /><text value=\"True\" class=\"literal\" /><text value=\"))\" /></content><interactions><interaction type=\"validatedInput\" isDefault=\"true\" startIndex=\"70\" endIndex=\"74\" /></interactions><output><content><text value=\"2\" /></content></output></code><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Pastikan kamu mengetik <code>True</code>.</p></body></html>"
          },
          {
            "title": "Reusing",
            "id": 82668,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Untuk menggunakan kembali jumlah suatu nilai dalam list, kita bisa menyimpannya dalam variabel seperti <code>seats_count</code>.</p><code version=\"2\" codelang=\"python\" name=\"script.py\" visible-if=\"always\"><content><text value=\"free_seats = [\" /><text value=\"False\" class=\"literal\" /><text value=\", \" /><text value=\"False\" class=\"literal\" /><text value=\", \" /><text value=\"True\" class=\"literal\" /><text value=\", \" /><text value=\"True\" class=\"literal\" /><text value=\", \" /><text value=\"False\" class=\"literal\" /><text value=\"]\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"seats_count = free_seats.count(\" /><text value=\"True\" class=\"literal\" /><text value=\")\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"print(seats_count)\" /></content><interactions><interaction type=\"fillTheGap\" isDefault=\"true\"><options><option startIndex=\"47\" endIndex=\"58\" /><option startIndex=\"59\" endIndex=\"60\" /><option correct=\"false\"><content><text value=\"print\" /></content></option></options></interaction></interactions><output><content><text value=\"2\" /></content></output></code><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Pastikan kamu memilih <code>seats_count</code>, diikuti oleh <code>=</code>.</p></body></html>",
            "hardModeContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Letakkan nilai yang dihitung dalam tanda kurung <code>count()</code>. Kamu dapat menghitung boolean dan menyimpan hasilnya dalam variabel.</p><p>Hitung jumlah entri <code>True</code> dalam <code>free_seats</code> dan simpan dalam <code>seats_count</code> agar kode mencetak <code>2</code>.</p><code version=\"2\" codelang=\"python\" name=\"script.py\" visible-if=\"always\"><content><text value=\"free_seats = [\" /><text value=\"False\" class=\"literal\" /><text value=\", \" /><text value=\"False\" class=\"literal\" /><text value=\", \" /><text value=\"True\" class=\"literal\" /><text value=\", \" /><text value=\"True\" class=\"literal\" /><text value=\", \" /><text value=\"False\" class=\"literal\" /><text value=\"]\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"seats_count = free_seats.count(\" /><text value=\"True\" class=\"literal\" /><text value=\")\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"print(seats_count)\" /></content><interactions><interaction type=\"fillTheGap\" isDefault=\"true\"><options><option startIndex=\"47\" endIndex=\"58\" /><option startIndex=\"59\" endIndex=\"60\" /><option startIndex=\"78\" endIndex=\"82\" /><option correct=\"false\"><content><text value=\"print\" /></content></option><option correct=\"false\"><content><text value=\"False\" /></content></option></options></interaction></interactions><output><content><text value=\"2\" /></content></output></code><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Pastikan kamu memilih <code>seats_count</code>, diikuti oleh <code>=</code>, dan terakhir <code>True</code>.</p></body></html>",
            "hardModeSelected": true
          },
          {
            "title": "At least once",
            "id": 88383,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Jika kita tidak ingin mengetahui jumlah pastinya, tetapi hanya ingin mengetahui apakah elemen seperti <code>\"sugar\"</code> ada, kita menggunakan keyword <code>in</code>.</p><code version=\"2\" codelang=\"python\" name=\"script.py\" visible-if=\"always\"><content><text value=\"ingredients = [\" /><text value=\"&quot;flour&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\", \" /><text value=\"&quot;butter&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\", \" /><text value=\"&quot;sugar&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\", \" /><text value=\"&quot;eggs&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\"]\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"print(\" /><text value=\"&quot;sugar&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"in\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" ingredients)\" /></content><interactions><interaction type=\"validatedInput\" isDefault=\"true\" startIndex=\"66\" endIndex=\"68\" /></interactions><output><content><text value=\"True\" /></content></output></code><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Pastikan kamu mengetik <code>in</code>.</p></body></html>"
          },
          {
            "title": "Boolean",
            "id": 88384,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Memeriksa apakah elemen seperti <code>\"sugar\"</code> ada dalam list seperti <code>\"ingredients\"</code> menghasilkan boolean, yaitu <code>True</code> atau <code>False</code>.</p><code version=\"2\" codelang=\"python\" name=\"script.py\" visible-if=\"always\"><content><text value=\"ingredients = [\" /><text value=\"&quot;flour&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\", \" /><text value=\"&quot;butter&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\", \" /><text value=\"&quot;sugar&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\", \" /><text value=\"&quot;eggs&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\"]\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"print(\" /><text value=\"&quot;sugar&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"in\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" ingredients)\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"print(\" /><text value=\"&quot;chocolate&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"in\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" ingredients)\" /></content><interactions><interaction type=\"fillTheGap\" isDefault=\"true\"><options><option startIndex=\"58\" endIndex=\"65\" /><option startIndex=\"66\" endIndex=\"68\" /><option startIndex=\"69\" endIndex=\"80\" /></options></interaction></interactions><output><content><text value=\"True\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"False\" /></content></output></code><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Pastikan kamu memilih <code>\"sugar\"</code>, diikuti oleh <code>in</code>, dan terakhir <code>ingredients</code>.</p></body></html>",
            "hardModeContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Gunakan <code>in</code> di antara nilai dan list. Hasilnya <code>True</code> jika nilai ada, atau <code>False</code> jika tidak.</p><p>Lengkapi pemeriksaan pertama agar mencetak <code>True</code>.</p><code version=\"2\" codelang=\"python\" name=\"script.py\" visible-if=\"always\"><content><text value=\"ingredients = [\" /><text value=\"&quot;flour&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\", \" /><text value=\"&quot;butter&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\", \" /><text value=\"&quot;sugar&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\", \" /><text value=\"&quot;eggs&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\"]\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"print(\" /><text value=\"&quot;sugar&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"in\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" ingredients)\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"print(\" /><text value=\"&quot;chocolate&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"in\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" ingredients)\" /></content><interactions><interaction type=\"fillTheGap\" isDefault=\"true\"><options><option startIndex=\"58\" endIndex=\"65\" /><option startIndex=\"66\" endIndex=\"68\" /><option startIndex=\"69\" endIndex=\"80\" /><option correct=\"false\"><content><text value=\"==\" /></content></option><option correct=\"false\"><content><text value=\"&quot;chocolate&quot;\" /></content></option></options></interaction></interactions><output><content><text value=\"True\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"False\" /></content></output></code><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Pastikan kamu memilih <code>\"sugar\"</code>, diikuti oleh <code>in</code>, dan terakhir <code>ingredients</code>.</p></body></html>",
            "hardModeSelected": true
          },
          {
            "title": "Store the boolean",
            "id": 88385,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Kita dapat menggunakan kembali boolean yang dikembalikan dengan menyimpannya dalam variabel seperti <code>has_sugar</code>.</p><code version=\"2\" codelang=\"python\" name=\"script.py\" visible-if=\"always\"><content><text value=\"ingredients = [\" /><text value=\"&quot;flour&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\", \" /><text value=\"&quot;butter&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\", \" /><text value=\"&quot;sugar&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\", \" /><text value=\"&quot;eggs&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\"]\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"has_sugar = \" /><text value=\"&quot;sugar&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"in\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" ingredients\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"print(has_sugar)\" /></content><interactions><interaction type=\"fillTheGap\" isDefault=\"true\"><options><option startIndex=\"52\" endIndex=\"61\" /><option startIndex=\"62\" endIndex=\"63\" /></options></interaction></interactions><output><content><text value=\"True\" /></content></output></code><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Pastikan kamu memilih <code>has_sugar</code>, diikuti oleh <code>=</code>.</p></body></html>",
            "hardModeContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Simpan hasil pemeriksaan apakah <code>\"sugar\"</code> ada dalam <code>ingredients</code> di variabel <code>has_sugar</code> agar kode menampilkan <code>True</code>.</p><code version=\"2\" codelang=\"python\" name=\"script.py\" visible-if=\"always\"><content><text value=\"ingredients = [\" /><text value=\"&quot;flour&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\", \" /><text value=\"&quot;butter&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\", \" /><text value=\"&quot;sugar&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\", \" /><text value=\"&quot;eggs&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\"]\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"has_sugar = \" /><text value=\"&quot;sugar&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"in\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" ingredients\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"print(has_sugar)\" /></content><interactions><interaction type=\"fillTheGap\" isDefault=\"true\"><options><option startIndex=\"52\" endIndex=\"61\" /><option startIndex=\"62\" endIndex=\"63\" /><option startIndex=\"64\" endIndex=\"71\" /><option startIndex=\"72\" endIndex=\"74\" /><option startIndex=\"75\" endIndex=\"86\" /><option correct=\"false\"><content><text value=\"==\" /></content></option></options></interaction></interactions><output><content><text value=\"True\" /></content></output></code><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Pastikan kamu memilih <code>has_sugar</code>, diikuti oleh <code>=</code>, <code>\"sugar\"</code>, <code>in</code>, dan terakhir <code>ingredients</code>.</p></body></html>",
            "hardModeSelected": true
          },
          {
            "title": "Question: Method call",
            "id": 82721,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Apa yang dilakukan <code>count()</code> saat diberi sebuah nilai?</p><selection iscode=\"false\" multiple=\"multiple\"><item value=\"1\" correct=\"true\">Ini memberi tahu kita seberapa sering nilai tersebut muncul dalam sebuah list</item><item value=\"2\" correct=\"false\">Ini menghitung semua elemen dalam list</item></selection><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Ini memberi tahu kita seberapa sering nilai tersebut muncul dalam sebuah list.</p></body></html>",
            "hardModeContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Apa hasil dari <code>[\"a\", \"b\", \"a\"].count(\"a\")</code>?</p><selection iscode=\"false\" multiple=\"multiple\"><item value=\"1\" correct=\"true\"><code>2</code></item><item value=\"2\" correct=\"false\"><code>3</code></item><item value=\"3\" correct=\"false\"><code>True</code></item></selection><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Pastikan kamu memilih <code>2</code>.</p></body></html>"
          },
          {
            "title": "Question: Element to count",
            "id": 82723,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Di mana kita menulis kode elemen yang ingin kita hitung dalam sebuah list?</p><selection iscode=\"false\" multiple=\"multiple\"><item value=\"1\" correct=\"true\">Di antara tanda kurung <code>.count()</code></item><item value=\"2\" correct=\"false\">Sebelum <code>.count()</code></item></selection><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Di antara tanda kurung <code>.count()</code>.</p></body></html>",
            "hardModeContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Ekspresi mana yang menghitung berapa kali <code>\"banana\"</code> muncul dalam <code>fruits</code>?</p><selection iscode=\"false\" multiple=\"multiple\"><item value=\"1\" correct=\"true\"><code>fruits.count(\"banana\")</code></item><item value=\"2\" correct=\"false\"><code>\"banana\".count(fruits)</code></item><item value=\"3\" correct=\"false\"><code>fruits.count()</code></item></selection><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Pastikan kamu memilih <code>fruits.count(\"banana\")</code>.</p></body></html>"
          },
          {
            "title": "Question: Any type",
            "id": 82724,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Jenis nilai apa yang bisa kita gunakan bersama <code>count()</code>?</p><selection iscode=\"false\" multiple=\"multiple\"><item value=\"1\" correct=\"true\">String, boolean, integer, dan float</item><item value=\"2\" correct=\"false\">Hanya string</item></selection><p visible-if=\"wrong\">String, boolean, integer, dan float.</p></body></html>",
            "hardModeContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Kita dapat menggunakan <code>count()</code> dengan string, boolean, integer, dan float.</p><p>Jika <code>flags = [True, False, True]</code>, apa hasil dari <code>flags.count(True)</code>?</p><selection iscode=\"false\" multiple=\"multiple\"><item value=\"1\" correct=\"true\"><code>2</code></item><item value=\"2\" correct=\"false\">Terjadi error karena <code>count()</code> hanya menerima string.</item><item value=\"3\" correct=\"false\"><code>3</code> karena list memiliki tiga nilai.</item></selection><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Pastikan kamu memilih <code>2</code>.</p></body></html>",
            "hardModeSelected": true
          },
          {
            "title": "Question: Reusing",
            "id": 82725,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Bagaimana kita dapat menggunakan kembali hasil yang diberikan oleh <code>count()</code>?</p><selection iscode=\"false\" multiple=\"multiple\"><item value=\"1\" correct=\"true\">Dengan membuat variabel dan menyimpannya di dalam</item><item value=\"2\" correct=\"false\">Kita tidak bisa menggunakan kembali hasilnya karena hasil itu selalu berubah</item></selection><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Dengan membuat variabel dan menyimpannya di dalam.</p></body></html>",
            "hardModeContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Kamu perlu menggunakan kembali jumlah kemunculan <code>\"done\"</code> dalam <code>tasks</code>. Baris mana yang menyimpan hasil tersebut?</p><selection iscode=\"false\" multiple=\"multiple\"><item value=\"1\" correct=\"true\"><code>done_count = tasks.count(\"done\")</code></item><item value=\"2\" correct=\"false\"><code>print(tasks.count(\"done\"))</code></item><item value=\"3\" correct=\"false\"><code>tasks.count(\"done\")</code></item></selection><p visible-if=\"wrong\"><code>done_count = tasks.count(\"done\")</code>.</p></body></html>"
          },
          {
            "title": "Question: At least once",
            "id": 88412,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Untuk apa kita bisa menggunakan keyword <code>in</code>?</p><selection iscode=\"false\" multiple=\"multiple\"><item value=\"1\" correct=\"true\">Memeriksa apakah list berisi sebuah elemen</item><item value=\"2\" correct=\"false\">Menghitung jumlah kemunculan elemen dalam list</item></selection><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Memeriksa apakah list berisi sebuah elemen.</p></body></html>",
            "hardModeContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Kita menggunakan keyword <code>in</code> untuk memeriksa apakah list berisi sebuah elemen.</p><p>Ekspresi mana yang memeriksa apakah <code>colors</code> berisi <code>\"blue\"</code>?</p><selection iscode=\"false\" multiple=\"multiple\"><item value=\"1\" correct=\"true\"><code>\"blue\" in colors</code></item><item value=\"2\" correct=\"false\"><code>colors.count(\"blue\")</code></item><item value=\"3\" correct=\"false\"><code>colors == \"blue\"</code></item></selection><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Pastikan kamu memilih <code>\"blue\" in colors</code>.</p></body></html>"
          },
          {
            "title": "Question: Boolean",
            "id": 88413,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Jenis nilai apa yang kita dapatkan saat menggunakan keyword <code>in</code>?</p><selection iscode=\"false\" multiple=\"multiple\"><item value=\"1\" correct=\"true\">Boolean seperti <code>True</code> atau <code>False</code></item><item value=\"2\" correct=\"false\">Sebuah angka </item></selection><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Boolean seperti <code>True</code> atau <code>False</code>.</p></body></html>",
            "hardModeContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Keyword <code>in</code> mengembalikan nilai boolean seperti <code>True</code> atau <code>False</code>.</p><p>Jika <code>colors = [\"red\", \"blue\"]</code>, apa hasil dari <code>\"blue\" in colors</code>?</p><selection iscode=\"false\" multiple=\"multiple\"><item value=\"1\" correct=\"true\"><code>True</code></item><item value=\"2\" correct=\"false\"><code>1</code></item><item value=\"3\" correct=\"false\"><code>\"blue\"</code></item></selection><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Pastikan kamu memilih <code>True</code>.</p></body></html>"
          },
          {
